# from:length: counts characters and survives very large numbers
>> s := ['ééééééééééééééé'].
Génn bind: (s duppitu dale: 0 guddaay: 20), taxaw.
Génn bind: (s duppitu dale: 10 guddaay: 20), taxaw.
Génn bind: (s duppitu dale: 14 guddaay: 1), taxaw.
Génn bind: (s duppitu tëb: 20), taxaw.
Génn bind: ['-'], taxaw.
Génn bind: (['abcdef'] dale: 2 guddaay: 2), taxaw.
Génn bind: (['abc'] dale: 1 guddaay: ['9e300'] lim), taxaw.
Génn bind: (['abc'] dale: 1 guddaay: ['-9e300'] lim), taxaw.
Génn bind: (['abc'] dale: ['9e300'] lim guddaay: 1), taxaw.
Génn bind: ['-'], taxaw.
Génn bind: (['abc'] dale: ['-9e300'] lim guddaay: 2), taxaw.
Génn bind: (['abc'] dale: ['nan'] lim guddaay: 2), taxaw.
Génn bind: (['abc'] dale: 0 guddaay: ['nan'] lim), taxaw.
Génn bind: ['-'], taxaw.
